<title>USA: Philadelphia $58.9 mln deal ylds 5.75 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia $58.9 mln deal ylds 5.75 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AH Williams &amp; Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $58.9 million Philadelphia Authority for Industrial Development lease revenue bonds at a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2027.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>PHILADELPHIA AUTHORITY FOR INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p>RE: $58,860,000</p>
<p>LEASE REVENUE BONDS, 1996 SERIES A</p>
<p>CITY OF PHILADELPHIA PROJECT</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 8/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE 2/15</p>
<p>    2/15	    Amount	  Coupon	Price</p>
<p>    Maturity	(million)	   (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    2000	    $0.975	  4.25	  4.25</p>
<p>    2001	    $1.015	  4.50	  4.50</p>
<p>    2002	    $1.065	  4.60	  4.60</p>
<p>    2003	    $1.110	  4.70	  4.70</p>
<p>    2004	    $1.165	  4.80	  4.80</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    2005	    $1.220	  6.00	  4.90</p>
<p>    2006	    $1.290	  6.00	  5.00</p>
<p>    2007	    $1.370	  6.00	  5.05</p>
<p>    2008	    $1.450	  5.05	  5.15</p>
<p>    2009	    $1.525	  5.15	  5.25</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    2010	    $1.605	  5.25	  5.35</p>
<p>    2011	    $1.690	  5.30	  5.40</p>
<p>    2012	    $1.780	  5.35	  5.45</p>
<p>    2017	    $10.435	 5.40	  5.65</p>
<p>    2027	    $31.185	 5.375	 5.75</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 2/15/2007 @ 102.00</p>
<p>		   2/15/2009 @ 100.00</p>
<p>*-APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The award is expected Nov 14, 1996</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on Nov 26, 1996</p>
<p>AH Williams &amp; Co</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
